{number: 115}
{title: The Light of the World Is Jesus}
{key: F}

{start_of_verse: 1}
The [F] whole world was lost in the darkness of sin,
The Light of the world is [C7] Jesus!
Like [F] sunshine at noonday, His glory shone in;
The [F] Light of the [C7] world is [F] Jesus!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Come to the [Bb] light, 'tis shining for [F] thee;
Sweetly the [Dm] light has [G7] dawned upon [C7] me;
Once I was [F] blind, but now I can see:
The [F] Light of the [C7] world is [F] Jesus!
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
No [F] darkness have we who in Jesus abide;
The Light of the world is [C7] Jesus!
We [F] walk in the light when we follow our Guide;
The [F] Light of the [C7] world is [F] Jesus!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
Ye [F] dwellers in darkness with sin-blinded eyes,
The Light of the world is [C7] Jesus!
Go, [F] wash at His bidding, and light will arise;
The [F] Light of the [C7] world is [F] Jesus!
{end_of_verse}
